<h2>Choosing the provision</h2>

<p>The first decision is which statute to invoke, and it is not a formality. Each route has its own character.</p>

<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Provision</th><th>Who may claim</th><th>Character of the proceeding</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Section 144 BNSS, 2023 (formerly Section 125 CrPC)</td><td>Wife, minor children, adult children unable to maintain themselves by reason of injury or infirmity, and parents</td><td>Summary, available irrespective of religion, before the Family Court exercising this jurisdiction</td></tr>
